# sobre_adp_quant.voc — Scale quantifiers before 'sobre' used adverbially ('sabe MUITO sobre X',
# 'aprendeu POUCO sobre') → about/concerning ADP → +5, and they must NOT be read
# as noun determiners. Add degree quantifiers.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

muito
pouco
bastante
nada
tudo
algo
